# GPU runtime machine

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before installing Python packages or starting
the backend. Chinese design notes live under the untracked `doc/`.

- Single machine: Unity, OBS, FastAPI and CUDA YOLO, all on `127.0.0.1:8000`.
- First install is `Backend/setup-vision.ps1` only. Never run `Backend/run.ps1`
  first, because it installs CPU torch.
- Daily start is `Backend/run-vision.ps1`. P0 is one recording through local CUDA
  inference; no shot detection, crosshair training, or cross-machine upload.
- RTX 50 series needs `-CudaTag cu128` or newer. Setup must print
  `OK gpu compute verified`.
- Do not commit `.pt` weights, recordings, or `.dem` files.
